# BuildKit applies this when building with -f apps/rowboat-www/Dockerfile.
#
# The Dockerfile COPYs repo-root-relative paths (apps/rowboat-www/...,
# packages/ui, packages/relationship-contract), so the build context must be the
# repo root. This keeps that context to the three trees it actually reads —
# mirroring apps/rowboat-api/Dockerfile.dockerignore.
*
!apps/rowboat-www
!packages/relationship-contract
!packages/ui

# Re-excluded after the allowlist above, so a working tree that has already been
# built or installed does not ship its output into the image context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
